# AF01–AF10 Independent Review Matrix

Allowed item decisions: PASS / REVISION_REQUIRED / FAIL.

## AF01

Verify exact reviewed version-dispatch source binding.

## AF02

Verify active-form version dispatch changes exactly one scalar status value and no other JSON value.

## AF03

Verify V1/V2 dispatch semantics, REJECT behavior, no heuristic fallback, and the 2.0.0 separate-reviewed-activation condition remain unchanged.

## AF04

Verify the future active dispatch path is explicit, unique, absent before activation, and not created by the finalization package.

## AF05

Verify exact reviewed Decision-0019 successor source binding.

## AF06

Verify exactly the three authorized successor text transformations and byte preservation of all other text.

## AF07

Verify Decision 0019 remains historically immutable and the finalized successor becomes operative only through later explicit reviewed activation.

## AF08

Verify the separately human-approved V2 hash-contract active form requires no further transformation and remains uninstalled.

## AF09

Verify Schema V2, V1 hash contract, zlib, and libpcap remain unchanged and no positive mapping, curl, analyzer, baseline, or repair side effect occurs.

## AF10

Verify independent human review of the finalization package is required before any Schema V2 activation.

## Overall decision

Allowed values:

- APPROVE_SCHEMA_V2_ACTIVATION_ARTIFACT_FINALIZATION
- REVISION_REQUIRED
- FAIL
